1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,650
every ai writing tool sounds the same.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:05,700
the model has no idea who you are.

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:07,350
there's only one fix. tell it.

4
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:11,417
it reads the prompts you already wrote.

5
00:00:11,417 --> 00:00:13,667
and turns it into instructions with numbers.

6
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:15,317
not "be concise". a number you can follow.

7
00:00:15,317 --> 00:00:16,917
then it checks a draft twice.

8
00:00:16,917 --> 00:00:19,267
generic ai text: caught by one, missed by the other.

9
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:21,717
someone else's clean writing: the exact reverse.

10
00:00:21,717 --> 00:00:23,467
neither test catches both. so it runs both.

11
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:26,117
this post scored 31 before. 95 after.
